WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:02.120
Trump is doing it.

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:09.140
He is starting to say there is funny business
as he starts to lose Michigan, as he starts

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:13.360
to lose Wisconsin, as Nevada may be beyond
repair for him.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:14.770
We don't know it's early.

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:17.450
I'm just telling you the numbers as of this
moment.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:21.520
Donald Trump came out at 2:00 a.m. last night
and he said we won Trump.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:25.850
Listen, guys, I hate that we were right about
these things.

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:29.670
But I told you Monday Trump would claim premature
victory when there was no victory to claim

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:31.900
he did it at two a.m. last night.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:36.960
Trump said he was winning Wisconsin, Michigan,
Pennsylvania, Georgia, North Carolina states

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:39.110
that had not yet been called.

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:44.030
We all knew the reality of the Red Mirage
scenario of huge numbers of outstanding absentee

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:45.370
and mail in ballots.

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:53.479
And this morning, slowly but surely, Wisconsin
flipped blue, small margin, Michigan flipped

00:00:53.479 --> 00:00:55.659
blue, small margin.

00:00:55.659 --> 00:01:01.229
We are anticipating at least a tightening
in Pennsylvania as they resume counting votes,

00:01:01.229 --> 00:01:03.530
although we don't know exactly how it will
go.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:06.790
Nevada still in the blue column.

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.670
So now Trump has to do it.

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:11.240
Now he has to question whether this is rigged.

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:16.740
Donald Trump tweeting just a little while
ago, quote, Last night, I was leading often

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:24.049
solidly in many key states, in almost all
instances, Democrat run and controlled.

00:01:24.049 --> 00:01:31.880
Then one by one, they started to magically
disappear as surprise ballot dumps were counted.

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:33.280
Very strange.

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:39.619
And the pollsters got it completely and historically
wrong.

00:01:39.619 --> 00:01:47.759
He is doing it, the president of the United
States is saying not just, oh, there are some

00:01:47.759 --> 00:01:53.820
questionable ballots in Florida and we have
the paper ballots and it's hanging chads and

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:54.820
we just have to look.

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:55.969
No, no, no, no, no.

00:01:55.969 --> 00:02:06.840
Trump is actually suggesting that swath tranches,
we could call them cohorts of imaginary mail

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:14.110
in ballots are being fabricated to steal states
from Trump.

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:19.780
The president of the United States is making
that assertion on Twitter.

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:21.570
They are counting ballots.

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:23.080
We knew this would happen.

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:29.750
Many states report in-person numbers very
quickly and then start counting mail in ballots

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:32.970
and then they stop for the night and then
they start again.

00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:40.140
I told you that this would happen, we predicted
it and I urged calm, I urged calm last night.

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:42.540
We have to wait for the ballots to be counted.

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:47.500
But now we are up against the situation where
Donald Trump is going to try to stop the ballots

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:48.960
from being counted.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:53.310
You have to really zoom out to understand
the authoritarian nature of what's going on.

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:54.730
Step one, claim of victory.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:56.660
You didn't really win.

00:02:56.660 --> 00:03:02.480
Trump may win, but when he claimed victory
last night, there was no one to claim claim

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:08.120
you were winning in states that you are not
actually winning in or where it is at least

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.090
unclear whether you are winning.

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:11.370
Trump did it.

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:18.510
And then when the numbers start to shift,
you have your own prior claims to point to.

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:23.010
Listen, I came out yesterday and we were ahead
and I said so.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.400
And then now it's changing.

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:29.010
Well, what's inappropriate is not that they
are now counting ballots.

00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:32.260
What was inappropriate was that he came out
and claimed victories.

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:35.710
He didn't actually have the mathematical standing
to claim.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:37.760
So we need to be extraordinarily vigilant.

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:42.160
Now, I, I wish I could come to you and say
what it is that we should be doing.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:43.980
I don't know.

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:48.060
I don't know if our systems are strong enough
to withstand this, because so far no system

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:50.700
has been able to hold Trump accountable.

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:53.230
Do we need to call our elected officials?

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:54.230
Who do we call?

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:55.230
What do we say?

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:56.230
What can they do?

00:03:56.230 --> 00:04:00.650
If I call Ed Markey, say, you know, look at
what trumps what can Ed Markey do?

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:01.650
I don't know.

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:03.420
I don't actually know what to do.

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:05.370
It is a crisis situation.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:09.960
So while we need to remain very calm as far
as.

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:13.700
We need to wait and see who wins a lot of
these states, Michigan looked very bad last

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:19.109
night, early for Joe Biden, then it looked
OK as of five minutes ago.

00:04:19.109 --> 00:04:21.070
Biden's ahead in Michigan.

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:22.200
We have to wait.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.960
We have to wait and see.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:26.120
But the cat is out of the bag.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:30.250
Trump is claiming they are stealing it from
him fraudulently.

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:32.860
Once that is done, it's crossing the Rubicon.

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:35.420
In a sense, there's no one ringing that bell.

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:39.320
If Donald Trump is starting with that this
early, that is what Donald Trump is going

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:40.320
to go with.

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:43.040
And we need to be very much prepared for it.

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:44.040
Let me know.

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:45.380
I want to hear from you.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:50.770
What should I be advising the audience to
do to prevent Trump from making credible allegations

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:53.280
of fraud when there is no such evidence?

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:54.950
I wish I had something for you.

00:04:54.950 --> 00:06:03.970
If you let me know, we can follow up on 

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:18.090
it tomorrow.

